<title>THAILAND: Unithai Line 1996 net turns to loss.</title>
<headline>Unithai Line 1996 net turns to loss.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial results for the year</p>
<p>ended December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)  Loss	2.79	vs  Profit   11.72</p>
<p>    Net	   Loss     79.65	vs  Profit  335.08</p>
<p>NOTE: Results are audited. Company's full name is Unithai Line Plc, a shipping firm.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
